# API and worker

- Require a session except Better Auth routes, `GET /health`, and `POST /test/login` when `NODE_ENV=test`.
- Outfit writes check `ownerId`. Discover queries force public and `ready` on the server.
- The client sends tags, hearts, visibility, content type, and byte size. The server chooses the object key and the next status.
- Generate short-lived read URLs. Do not return storage keys or moderation `raw` payloads to normal clients.
- Admin routes check `ADMIN_EMAILS`.
- Call storage, weather, and moderation through their provider interfaces.

```ts
// BAD
if (body.status === "ready") outfit.status = "ready";

// GOOD
const next = transition(outfit.status, { type: "upload_completed" });
```
